1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,851
Zara: I ordered a pizza. I did NOT order
that.

2
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:06,274
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: The Last Floor. Part
one: the lobby.

3
00:00:06,944 --> 00:00:09,303
Zara: Nope. Nope. Nope.

4
00:00:09,973 --> 00:00:11,474
Bell: Zara! Behind me!

5
00:00:12,144 --> 00:00:15,410
Bell: Elevators beep and open. Zombies
love that.

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,650
Bell: Ding. Going down. Basement.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,539
Bell: Evac helicopter. Roof. Six a.m.

8
00:00:23,209 --> 00:00:25,287
Zara: Twelve floors. In the dark.

9
00:00:25,407 --> 00:00:26,595
Bell: Then we start now.

10
00:00:27,265 --> 00:00:30,901
Bell: Zombies hate stairs. No hands for
the rail.

11
00:00:31,571 --> 00:00:33,786
Zara: Floor two. Every door is open.

12
00:00:34,456 --> 00:00:36,082
Bell: Close them. One by one.

13
00:00:36,752 --> 00:00:38,465
Omar: Don't hurt me! I'm a chef!

14
00:00:39,135 --> 00:00:40,285
Omar: I brought my pan.

15
00:00:40,405 --> 00:00:41,904
Zara: A pan is not a plan.

16
00:00:42,574 --> 00:00:45,363
Omar: Also, meet Pip. Mrs. Lin's parrot.

17
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:47,497
Pip: Open the door! Open the door!

18
00:00:47,617 --> 00:00:49,684
Bell: Pip. Not that sentence.

19
00:00:50,354 --> 00:00:52,013
Zara: Something is climbing after us.

20
00:00:52,683 --> 00:00:56,026
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Next: the stairs.
Follow for part two.

